  "@type": "Recipe",
  "name": "Place with Crab & Kalamata Olive Stuffing",
  "text": "Place with Crab & Kalamata Olive Stuffing\n\nPreparation time:\n\nCooking time:\n\nYield: 4\n\nIngredients\n\n4 fillets of plaice,\n\n50 ml white wine,\n\njuice of 1 lemon,\n\n50 g unsalted butter,\n\n1 finely chopped shallot,\n\n1 clove of garlic (peeled and crushed),\n\n1/2 medium chilli (deseeded and finely chopped),\n\n100 g fresh white breadcrumbs,\n\n30 g finely chopped Kalamata olives,\n\n1/2 bunch flat leaf parsley (finely chopped),\n\nzest of 1 lemon,\n\nextra virgin olive oil,\n\nsalt & pepper.\n\nPreparation\n\n1.Heat the butter in a saucepan.\n\n2. Add the shallot, garlic and chilli, and cook for 2 minutes, until soft.\n\n3. Add the breadcrumbs and cook for a further 1 minute.\n\n4. Remove from the heat and add the crab, olives, parsley and lemon zest, and mix well.\n\n5. If the stuffing seems dry add a splash of olive oil and season.\n\n6. Preheat the oven to 200C/Gas 6.\n\n7. Put the stuffing in the middle of each fillet and roll up from the tail to the head.\n\n8. Place in an ovenproof baking dish and add olive olive, lemon juice and white wine.\n\n9. Bake for 15 minutes.\n\n10. Serve with spinach and buttered potatoes.",
  "recipeYield": "4",
